{"seq":2,"slug":"architectures","title":"架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/architectures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"s4-structured-ssm","title":"S4 结构化状态空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/architectures/s4-structured-ssm","wordCount":1574,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"mamba-selective-ssm","title":"Mamba 选择性状态空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/architectures/mamba-selective-ssm","wordCount":1624,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"hardware-aware-parallel-scan","title":"硬件感知并行扫描","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/architectures/hardware-aware-parallel-scan","wordCount":1676,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"架构\">架构</h1><p>基础章给出的是一个「线性时不变」系统：状态转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、输入矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、输出矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 在整个序列上保持不变。这个性质让卷积形式成立，却也带来一个根本缺陷——系统无法根据当前看到的内容决定记住什么、忘掉什么。这一章讲的，就是研究者如何在保住效率的前提下，一步步给这个系统装上「选择性」与「跑得快」两样东西。</p>\n<p>第一篇 <a href=\"s4-structured-ssm\">S4 结构化状态空间</a> 解决工程可行性。朴素 SSM 在长序列上算卷积核既慢又数值不稳。S4 的贡献是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵约束成「对角加低秩」这种结构化形式，再配合 HiPPO 初始化，让卷积核能被高效且稳定地计算出来。后续的 S4D、DSS 等对角化简方案也在这篇里交代清楚。</p>\n<p>第二篇 <a href=\"mamba-selective-ssm\">Mamba 选择性状态空间</a> 是整个 hub 的转折点。Mamba 让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 和步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 变成输入的函数，于是同一层在不同位置会有不同的动态——模型终于能内容感知地筛选信息。代价是参数随时间变化，卷积形式失效，只能回到递归形式。这就把球踢给了下一篇。</p>\n<p>第三篇 <a href=\"hardware-aware-parallel-scan\">硬件感知并行扫描</a> 补上让递归依然飞快的那块拼图。它讲并行前缀扫描算法如何在 GPU 上把「看似串行」的递归并行化，讲核函数融合怎么避免把巨大的隐状态写回显存，以及 Mamba-2 用「状态空间对偶（SSD）」把这套扫描重写成可以走矩阵乘法单元的形式，从而比 Mamba-1 更快、更容易和注意力混合。</p>\n<p>三篇连起来回答一个完整问题：怎样得到一个既会选择、又跑得比注意力快的序列主干。带着这个主干，我们就能进入应用章。</p>\n"}